    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">peccātrix</span></b> , īcis,
			f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				female sinner</i> (post-class.), <i><span class="en">Paul.
				Nol. Carm. 28, 127</span></i>;  Hier. adv.
			Joann. Jerosol. n. 4; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Luc. 7,
			39</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			Adj., <i>sinning</i>, <i>sinful</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">peccatrix anima, Prud. Cath. prooem. 35: gens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Spect. 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">generatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Marc. 8, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 1
					Macc. 1, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
